    "title": "Gretna routs William Campbell 38-0 in Dogwood District showdown - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Craig Smith ,\n1 days ago GRETNA, Va. (WSET) — Gretna’s defense and special teams set the tone early and never let up in a lopsided Dogwood District showdown in the Hawks Nest. Gretna led 20-0 at halftime against visiting William Campbell. The second half opened with a strong kickoff return that helped set up another Gretna touchdown, pushing the lead to 36-0. Read full article\n1",
